// Title: Copy .DMP/.DUMP Files From Remote Share Via Cmd.EXE
// ID: 044ba588-dff4-4918-9808-3f95e8160606
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2022-09-27
// Tags: attack.credential-access
// Description: Detects usage of the copy builtin cmd command to copy files with the ".dmp"/".dump" extension from a remote share
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "copy ") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS " \\\\\\\\")) AND (where(CommandLine ICONTAINS ".dmp") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS ".dump") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS ".hdmp"))) AND ((where(Image IENDSWITH "\\cmd.exe")) OR (where(OriginalFileName = "Cmd.Exe"))))
